{"4694380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Today Tomorrow and the Next", "steam_appid": 4694380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re an entrepreneur who has poured your life savings into a scrap recycling business. Now it’s time to put in the work and turn it into something real. Your job is simple: use the crane to <strong>lift metal scrap</strong>, drop it <strong>into the crusher</strong>, and place the resulting <strong>cubes onto the pickup platform</strong> so the refinery team can collect them before morning. <strong>Use your phone</strong> to order better crane parts, find higher-paying customers, and upgrade to a faster car and a bigger house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple… in theory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694380/extras/890fc03ee0eb7298b1717e3516f3bf2d.poster.avif?t=1781252910\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694380/extras/890fc03ee0eb7298b1717e3516f3bf2d.webm?t=1781252910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4694380/extras/890fc03ee0eb7298b1717e3516f3bf2d.mp4?t=1781252910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Day-to-Day</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Wake up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Crush scrap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Get upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•Go to bed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rinse repeat</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Costs as much as a ☕ coffee, but is fun for longer and is caffeine-free!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin